<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef steady to firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck and round cuts firm, while middle meats rather uneven. Beef trimmings firm on light demand and offerings. -USDA</p>
